"The Guild seal on the Hollow's door has been broken and set back so that it looks whole."
"Inside, the Hollow is three caverns of root and black stone going down to its core chamber."
"The ground around the Mother Beech is gray and dead in a ring thirty paces wide."
"Old Greyhand, the treant, is rooted across the door, blackened, and lets no one by."
"Blightstones heaped at the core are souring it; purifying or removing them saves the Hollow."
"A soured dungeon core cleansed of blight becomes a young, clean dungeon again, and a rich one."
"Corrupted beasts in the Hollow run Level 15 to 30; its blighted guardian is Level 35."
